a.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-leaves-algerian-cup-match-after-crowd-throws-objects-everything-you-need-to-know/articleshow/126718471.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-20T01:49:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126718427,imgsize-592447.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Happy birthday to a terrific guy!’: Trump–Epstein birthday message recreated in giant 10 ft mockup near US Capitol]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126715599.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A striking ten-foot installation on the National Mall recreates a controversial birthday letter attributed to Donald Trump for Jeffrey Epstein. The interactive artwork, created by the Secret Handshake group, encourages public messages to the administration. This bold display, timed before Epstein's birthday, reignites scrutiny over the disputed correspondence and joins a series of recent anti-Trump installations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/happy-birthday-to-a-terrific-guy-trumpepstein-birthday-message-recreated-in-giant-10-ft-mockup-near-us-capitol/articleshow/126715599.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/happy-birthday-to-a-terrific-guy-trumpepstein-birthday-message-recreated-in-giant-10-ft-mockup-near-us-capitol/articleshow/126715599.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-20T01:12:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126715789,imgsize-749225.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Too stupid even for him’: Trump’s niece reacts after US letter links Greenland demand to Nobel snub]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" styl