facing difficulties obtaining official garbage bins mandated by City Hall for an anti-rat campaign. Residents are unable to find the bins in stores or receive them through online orders. The city blames an outside vendor for the supply issues. Buildings must use these bins by summer or face fines. Sanitation workers also find the new bins cumbersome.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/annoyed-with-sanitation-how-missing-garbage-bins-triggered-nycs-strangest-urban-crisis/articleshow/126706247.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/annoyed-with-sanitation-how-missing-garbage-bins-triggered-nycs-strangest-urban-crisis/articleshow/126706247.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-19T23:22:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126706675,imgsize-148372.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['How greedy they are': Greenland leader blasts Americans as Trump revives Greenland takeover talk]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126700720.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Greenlanders are making their stance clear. They are protesting against American pressure to buy their island. A politician stated that Greenlanders do not value wealth or greed. They highlighted their own values and rights. The islanders are aware of their resources but prioritize their way of life. They also noted historical injustices faced by indigenous peoples in America.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/how-greedy-they-are-greenland-leader-blasts-americans-as-trump-revives-greenland-takeover-talk/articleshow/126700720.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/how-greedy-they-are-greenland-leader-blasts-americans-as-trump-revives-greenland-