 type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126701743,imgsize-46604.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[What lies beneath Greenland’s ice may change sea-level predictions worldwide]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126676020.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/what-lies-beneath-greenlands-ice-may-change-sea-level-predictions-worldwide/articleshow/126676020.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/what-lies-beneath-greenlands-ice-may-change-sea-level-predictions-worldwide/articleshow/126676020.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-19T22:20:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126701575,imgsize-32170.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Criminal in nature’: Yunus defends minority-related incidents in Bangladesh, says only 71 of 645 communal]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126699256.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Bangladesh's interim government claims most 2025 incidents involving minorities were criminal, not communal. Out of 645 cases, only 71 had religious motives, including temple vandalism and threats. The government emphasizes accurate classification to combat misinformation, but minority groups question the assessment, fearing it emboldens criminals.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/criminal-in-nature-yunus-defends-minority-related-incidents-in-bangladesh-says-only-71-of-645-communal/articleshow/126699256.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/criminal-in-nature-yunus-defends-minority-related